          "es": "Sigurd le dijo su nombre. Entonces Fáfnir le dio una advertencia.",
          "en": "Sigurd told him his name. Then Fafnir gave him a warning."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese oro será tu muerte, dijo, y la muerte de todo el que lo posea.",
          "en": "That gold will be your death, he said, and the death of everyone who owns it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y mi hermano Regin me traicionó. A ti también te traicionará.",
          "en": "And my brother Regin betrayed me. He will betray you too."
        },
